## Task
Add an endpoint to cancel an order: POST /orders/{id}/cancel.
- 404 if the order does not exist.
- Only pending orders can be cancelled. For any other status, respond
  with 409 and the conflict error code.
- On success, set the status to cancelled and return the updated order
  with status 200.
Register the route in orderRoutes and follow the existing conventions.

